{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2021-04-15 12:39:00', 'title': 'SMASH AND RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES ANNOUNCE PARTNERSHIP TO HELP STUDENTS IN UNDERREPRESENTED COMMUNITIES OVERCOME BARRIERS IN PURSUING STEM CAREERS', 'text': "WALTHAM, MASS., APRIL 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: RTX), A LEADING AEROSPACE AND DEFENSE COMPANY, AND SMASH, ONE OF AMERICA'S FIRST SCIENCE, TECHNOLOGY, ENGINEERING AND MATH (STEM) EDUCATION PROGRAMS DEDICATED TO STUDENTS OF COLOR, TODAY ANNOUNCED A FIVE-YEAR STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO PROVIDE EDUCATIONAL OPPORTUNITIES, SCHOLARSHIPS AND INTERNSHIPS TO HIGH SCHOOL AND COLLEGE STUDENTS INTERESTED IN PURSUING ENGINEERING AND TECHNOLOGY CAREERS."}